      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-04-12_WidnesExaminer_art0040" n="art0040">
        <head>MAN friAET3APPED.</head>
        <p>A MAN friAET3APPED.</p>
        <p>"Off Colour" and unfit for work.</p>
        <p>Heavy, Languid, No Appetite. Acute Indigestion and Headaches. Now enjoys Energy and Strength. Made Vigorous and hearty by</p>
