        <head>BILLIARDS.</head>
        <p>BILLIARDS.</p>
        <p>LIBERAL CLUB v. CATHOLIC ASSOCIATION.</p>
        <p>A considerable amount of interest was taken in the first meeting at billiards between the Liberal Club and the Catholic Young Nlens Association on Thursday night, especially as the Catholics had twice conquered the Conservatives. Twelve gams of 100 up were played at the Liberal Club, each side winning six, but an advan- tage of 75 points rested with the:homesters. Scores : LIBERALS. CAT HOLICS. D. Tinnion R. Smith G. Marshall E. V. Walker lOO J. Durkin 4B W. Green G. Millington 3. Davies W. Whittaker J. Halliwell E. Wilson 1 63 P. Cunningham .100 W. Woods H. Summerville 1,056 981 981</p>
