      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-04-12_WidnesExaminer_art0137" n="art0137">
        <head>AND GENRRAL PRI NTING</head>
        <p>AND GENRRAL PRI NTING</p>
        <p>INVOICES, Ruled or Plnin, printpd to any SiZ9 or pattern on b'ue, white or fancy paper.</p>
