        <p>THu BOAT RACC—This great event resulted in a win for Cambridge. Time as taken by Benson's Chronograph, 19mins. 24 secs. Time last year, 20min5. 35secs. The cat at a Grays (Essex) hotel walked on board a ship some months back, and forgetting to walk back in time was taken to sea. The ship returned in due course, and the same night the cat was heard mewing outside thelotel door.</p>
